sacrifice altar
---------------
                      sacrifice                        bonus
                      ---------------------------      ---------------
- clumsy              hiding in bushes does not work   +10  spell points

- fire prone          x2 damage from fire              +10  spell points
                                                       2    spell coupons

- hollow bones        x2 damage from melee             +10  spell points
                                                       -50% fall damage
                                                       +25% speed
                                                       +50% jump distance
                         
- tunnel vision       no peripheral vision             +10  spell points
                                                       +25% speed

- defenceless         no weapon at start               +20  spell points
                                                       +1   emergency teleport per level

- myopic              -50% vision distance             +20  spell points
                                                       5    spell coupons

- breathless          -50% stamina                     +20  spell points
                      -50% speed                       gas  has no effect

- wraithlike          -80% health                      +30  spell points
                                                       limited wall walk
                                                       +25 magical armour

- glass bones         x2 damage from melee             +30  spell points
                      x4 damage from falling           +50% speed
                                                       jump damage
                                                       +1   emergency teleport per level
                                                       +50 magical armour
                                                       regeneration

- one legged          every move is a tiring jump      +40  spell points
                                                       +1   emergency teleport per level
                                                       +50% stamina recovery
                                                       x2   all damage dealt
                                                       limited levitation


essential features
------------------
gods
  orcus                           (black)
    - firebolt
    - emergency teleport
    - limited levitation
  surt, the fire giant            (orange)
    - firebolt
    - immunity to fire and lava
    - damage +10%
    - speed -20%
  ares, god of war                (red)
    - firebolt
    - damage +20%
    - speed +20%
    - limited levitation per level
  morrigan, the demon queen       (blue)
    - fast missile
    - limited wraithwalk per level
    - magical armour 1d20
    - speed +50%
  - lilith                        (white)
  - loviater                      (yellow)
    - darknes
  - horned god                    (green)
  sacrificing an acolyte of the same god - bad
abilities
  - Hollow Bones: Fall damage is halved and you move silently, but strong winds can knock you off balance.
  - Glass Bones: Take double damage from falls and blunt impacts, but your strikes are unnaturally precise.
  - keep a percentage of money or stats each time you restart
  - madness as an ability - randomly fire a spell
  - bloodfeaster - each corpse can be drained / chance of resurrecting something much stronger
  - lightbringer - light follows you randomly
  - demonbloodpact - vow to not hurt demons
  - breathless - gas weapons have no effect
  - wraithwalk - walk into walls
  - take on limitations at start e.g one leg, limited jump, reduced spell cost
  - levitation essential for chasms and return trip
weapon slots
  - etherblast to hit ghosts in walls
  - emergency teleport
spells
  - powerword kill
  - rot living flesh
  - more lich like spells
  - spell points to collect
  - all spells are availabl
  - spell coupons
  - spells need to have a cost that can be influenced by specializing
  - shrines that reduce spell points
