  - chests need to contain something and those items destroyed when the chest is
  - projectile collision with projectile
  - boulders that can crush
  - cobwebs burns and get you stuck
  - ice weapon and shattering
  - intelligent monsters when hurt should escape
  - anti magic areas
  - anti anti magic areas
  - debug shell "add monst"
  - "You have used up your 5 free stabs included with the basic plan. If you wish to stab more..."
  - Allies will follow you around and defend you; also thinking you
    can set an ally with a basic programmed task - explore/defend/attack
  - Enemy souls can be harvested to add to your life force. Thinking
